- **Task Grouping:** 
  - Group similar functionalities¡ªfor instance, all puzzle-related tasks (creating, shuffling, checking completion) can be grouped together to streamline implementation.
  
- **Additional Considerations:** 
  - Address UI flow with respect to how users interact with game features, especially when starting new games, saving progress, or viewing hints, as this contributes to usability in smaller-scale projects as well.

Overall, these insights aim to improve the task plan's clarity, feasibility, and effectiveness, ensuring a smoother development process and better guidance for the development team.
