- **Clarity:** More detailed descriptions of the methods within `game.py`, particularly around edge cases, would be beneficial. For instance, detailing what happens if a player attempts to rotate a piece that is already correctly positioned or if there are attempts to load an incomplete puzzle from `progress.txt`.
